  "metadata": {
    "description": "Integrated 2-Stage Pipeline test dataset: Stage 1 (Section Load Balancing) feeds Stage 2 (CSP Timetable Scheduling).",
    "notes": [
      "ITS101 (14 students, cap 13) forces 2 sections [7,7]; corequisite ITS101L (14 students, cap 8) also forces 2 sections [7,7] -- paired positionally (SEC1<->SEC1, SEC2<->SEC2) for non-overlap enforcement in Stage 2.",
      "CS101 (55 students, cap 30) forces 2 sections [28,27] -- only LEC-A/LEC-B (cap 30) can legally host the 28-student section.",
      "MATH201 (20 students, cap 25) fits in a single section [20].",
      "No building contains both Lecture and Lab room types (North Hall = Lecture only, East Annex = Lab only), mirroring the campus-layout constraint from the standalone scheduling engine test."
    ]
  },
